        "conceptId": "er_verbs_present",
        "type": "grammar",
        "title": "Regular -er verbs in the present tense",
        "explanation": "Verbs like \"chanter\" and \"respirer\" follow the regular -er pattern: je chante, tu chantes, il/elle chante.",
        "examples": [
          {
            "french": "Je chante.",
            "english": "I sing."
